<title>HONG KONG: Trading of Cosmos Machinery shr suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Cosmos Machinery shr suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of machinery distributor Cosmos Machinery Enterprises Ltd was suspended as of the start of afternoon trade on Friday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The shares closed the morning session at HK$1.00, up HK$0.19 or 23.46 percent. Volume was 3.03 million shares worth HK$2.81 million.</p>
<p>Cosmos Machinery is a machinery distributor and distilled water bottler.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
